<li>Gerd Binnig, Heinrich Rohrer, C. Gerber, dan E. Weibel: Tunneling through a Controllable Vacuum Gap, Appl. Phys. Lett. 40, 178 (1982)</li>
<li>G. Binnig, H. Rohrer, C. Gerber, E. Weibel: Surface studies by scanning tunneling microscopy. Phys. Rev. Lett. 49/1, S. 57 – 61 (1982)</li>
</ul>

